{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受熱帶低壓同冷空氣共同影響，海南持續下暴雨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海南多地昨日起下暴雨，引發部分地區水浸，當局在附近拉起警戒線，防止人車靠近，截至昨日，南部地區降雨量累計已超過300毫米，氣象部門預計，未來三日降雨會持續。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-2000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gLaE3l5tz31789303926.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-2000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當局亦將暴雨預警由三級升至二級，部分景區昨日起暫停營業，多地水庫要洩洪。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T12:58:24.979084+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}